harry (eng): LGTM from me pending the TS caveat (already added).

linda (docs): awesome — i'll merge this evening if no regressions. i'll also add a short doc release note and open a follow-up to add the harness into examples/ci as a nightly smoke test. thanks all for the quick reviews.
